---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import GuideHero from '../../components/GuideHero.astro';
import GuideTable from '../../components/GuideTable.astro';

const pot = 'https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FLYWNYQ?tag=dailyvirald06-20';
const fryer = 'https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0H87WV6N4?tag=dailyvirald06-20';
const hero = '/images/reviews/b00flywnyq/weeknight-soup.jpg';
const rows = [
    {
        name: 'Instant Pot Duo, 6 qt',
        href: pot,
        image: hero,
        alt: 'The Instant Pot on the counter beside a bowl of soup.',
        goodWhen: 'You walk in tired and dinner is still a pot of food: soup, beans, rice, or a slow cook.',
        limit: 'It takes counter space. Quick release sends out hot steam, so keep your hands clear.',
    },
    {
        name: 'Ninja Air Fryer Pro, 5 qt',
        href: fryer,
        image: '/images/reviews/b0h87wv6n4/crispy-fries.jpg',
        alt: 'The Ninja air fryer basket is open, with fries ready to plate.',
        goodWhen: 'You want fries, chicken, or vegetables crisp without waiting on a cold oven.',
        limit: 'A big family may need two batches. It is not the same texture as a deep fryer.',
    },
];
---

<Base
    title="Best weeknight cooker: Instant Pot or air fryer"
    description="Compare the Instant Pot Duo 6 qt with the Ninja Air Fryer Pro 5 qt. Pick the pot for one-pot meals, or the air fryer for crisp food."
>
    <nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/guides/">Guides</a> / <span aria-current="page">Weeknight cooker</span>
    </nav>
    <h1>Best weeknight cooker: Instant Pot or air fryer</h1>
    <GuideHero src={hero} alt="The Instant Pot on the counter beside a bowl of soup." />
    <p>You get home late, and dinner is still ahead of you. The right machine depends on whether the food should simmer in one pot or come out crisp.</p>
    <p><strong>Our pick for a one-pot meal:</strong> the Instant Pot Duo 6 qt. It can pressure cook, slow cook, steam, sauté, and keep food warm. The claim is pressure cooking can be up to 70% faster than older methods. It is listed for up to 6 people.</p>
    <p><strong>Our pick when the food should be crisp:</strong> the Ninja Air Fryer Pro 5 qt. It air fries, bakes, roasts, reheats, and dehydrates. The claim is hot air, up to 400°F, crisps food with little or no oil. It holds up to 4 pounds of fries or 5 pounds of wings.</p>
    <p class="notice">Price at the time of writing. Check Amazon for today's price.</p>
    <p class="notice">As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
    <p>
        <a class="cta-amazon" href={pot} rel="sponsored nofollow">See today's price for the 6 qt Instant Pot</a>
    </p>
    <GuideTable rows={rows} />
    <p>
        Read the <a href="/reviews/instant-pot-duo-6-qt-review-save-time-in-the-kitchen-b00flywnyq/">Instant Pot review</a> and the
        <a href="/reviews/ninja-air-fryer-pro-5-qt-review-save-time-on-meals-b0h87wv6n4/">Ninja air fryer review</a> before you clear counter space.
    </p>
</Base>

<style>
    .crumb { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .crumb a { color: var(--muted); }
    .cta-amazon {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--amazon);
        color: var(--amazon-ink);
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        margin: 8px 0 18px;
    }
</style>
